},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: It looks like they've got Vrang with them. These bastards...",
["id"] = "s2_3692",
["timestamp"] = 1794896989,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: I thought you were dead, Terry.",
["id"] = "s2_3693",
["timestamp"] = 1794897002,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: No, Walt, I'm still alive. That shot you took at me back in Ratchet only missed my heart by an inch.",
["id"] = "s2_3694",
["timestamp"] = 1794897004,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Well, not much chance I'd miss at this range.",
["id"] = "s2_3695",
["timestamp"] = 1794897011,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: You might have failed to notice that you are outnumbered.",
["id"] = "s2_3696",
["timestamp"] = 1794897015,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Just so--no matter how fast these thugs are, my first shot is aimed at you.",
["id"] = "s2_3697",
["timestamp"] = 1794897018,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: It seems you've made some fast friends, Walt. This orc filth refused to give you up. If only he knew how little loyalty means to you.",
["id"] = "s2_3698",
["timestamp"] = 1794897023,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: It's not about loyalty. It's about honor. That orc knows more about honor than the Lord Admiral ever did. That's why I left.",
["id"] = "s2_3699",
["timestamp"] = 1794897031,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Listen to me, Terry, just take these men and leave. Tell Benedict or whomever sent you that I'm dead. Walk away.",
["id"] = "s2_3700",
["timestamp"] = 1794897038,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink says: I can't do that. You know what happens to deserters. Put your rifle down and come peacefully... or don't. The bounty is \"dead or alive\" and I still owe you for Ratchet.",
["id"] = "s2_3701",
["timestamp"] = 1794897045,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Dammit, Terry...",
["id"] = "s2_3702",
["timestamp"] = 1794897054,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Terry Longdrink",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Terry Longdrink yells: Attack!",
["id"] = "s2_3703",
["timestamp"] = 1794897056,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Sorry if they roughed you up, Vrang. If I had known they got you, I'd have come running.",
["id"] = "s2_3704",
["timestamp"] = 1794897069,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vrang Wildgore",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Vrang Wildgore says: Is it true--you deserted your brothers in arms?",
["id"] = "s2_3705",
["timestamp"] = 1794897075,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Yes, Vrang, it is true. When Daelin Proudmoore took control of Theramore, he did terrible things. Dishonorable things that I could not be a part of.",
["id"] = "s2_3706",
["timestamp"] = 1794897080,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vrang Wildgore",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Vrang Wildgore says: I see. I can respect a man who values his honor and does not compromise his convictions.",
["id"] = "s2_3707",
["timestamp"] = 1794897089,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Walton",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Walton says: Thank you, Vrang.",
["id"] = "s2_3708",
["timestamp"] = 1794897094,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Vrang Wildgore",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Vrang Wildgore says: Lok-tar, Walton.",
["id"] = "s2_3709",
["timestamp"] = 1794897096,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonmage-Windseeker",
