s0_2481\",\"timestamp\":1794103257},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonpriest Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:12737::::::::5:1487:::::::::|h[Gloom Weed]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2482\",\"timestamp\":1794103275},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonpriest Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"level\":5},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:12737::::::::5:1487:::::::::|h[Gloom Weed]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2483\",\"timestamp\":1794103293},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: Go on and have a seat near the fire and we can get started.\",\"id\":\"s0_2484\",\"timestamp\":1794103397},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: All you need to start a camp of your own is a basic campfire. Cooks can generally teach you how to make one of those.\",\"id\":\"s0_2485\",\"timestamp\":1794103401},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: Once your campfire is down, you can place all sorts of camp fixtures around it.\",\"id\":\"s0_2486\",\"timestamp\":1794103409},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: Sufficiently skilled leatherworkers, for example, can place a tent like this one behind me.\",\"id\":\"s0_2487\",\"timestamp\":1794103415},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: Every trade has something they can contribute to your camp, even fishermen!\",\"id\":\"s0_2488\",\"timestamp\":1794103422},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: Then, all you need to do is have a seat near the fire and soak it all in. After a few minutes of resting, you'll gain various boons that will help you in your travels.\",\"id\":\"s0_2489\",\"timestamp\":1794103428},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: If you just sit still and rest for a few more moments, you'll gain a benefit from having rested near the tent I have set up behind me.\",\"id\":\"s0_2490\",\"timestamp\":1794103438},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Eleanor Shackleton\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Eleanor Shackleton says: That's about the gist of it. Once you've gained your boon from resting near the fire, speak with me again.\",\"id\":\"s0_2491\",\"timestamp\":1794103447},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonpriest Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"level\":6},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:279937::::::::6:1487:::::::::|h[Collecting Basket]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2492\",\"timestamp\":1794103493},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonpriest Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"level\":6},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:208185::::::::6:1487:::::::::|h[The Apothecary's Metaphysical Primer]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2493\",\"timestamp\":1794103524},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Simonpriest Windseeker\",\"sex\":3,\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"level\":6},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:286176::::::::6:1487::11:::::::|h[Executor's Motivator]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_2494\",\"timestamp\":1794103544},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Deathguard Burgess\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Deathguard Burgess says: I thank you for the motivation.\",\"id\":\"s0_2495\",\"timestamp\":1794103577},{\"recordedBy\":\"Simonpriest-Windseeker\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Deathguard Cyrus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Deathguard Cyrus says: As the Dark Lady wills.\",\"timestamp\":1794103585,\"id\":\"s0_2496\"},{\"